---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="P6｜Investment Matrix｜AI Platform Evolution｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P6</div>
    <h1>技術節點，如何轉換成產業觀察？</h1>
    <p>
      不直接從股票開始，而是先確認技術節點、
      供應鏈位置與證據強度。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">PROCESS</span>
      <h3>先進製程</h3>
      <p>製程節點、產能、設備與材料需求。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">PACKAGING</span>
      <h3>先進封裝</h3>
      <p>CoWoS、SoIC、Chiplet 與異質整合。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">OPTICAL</span>
      <h3>光互連</h3>
      <p>CPO、光引擎、光纖與高速互連。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">MATERIALS</span>
      <h3>材料與設備</h3>
      <p>尋找真正進入製程、驗證與量產的供應商。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
      <h3>電力與散熱</h3>
      <p>AI Server 與資料中心的基礎設施瓶頸。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">SYSTEM</span>
      <h3>AI Platform</h3>
      <p>效能、功耗、成本與系統整合。</p>
    </article>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="feature">
  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">EVIDENCE MATRIX</div>
        <h2>三個問題</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">

      <article class="map-card">
        <div class="number">01</div>
        <h3>技術在哪裡？</h3>
        <p>
          確認技術在 AI Platform 中的實際位置。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="map-card">
        <div class="number">02</div>
        <h3>誰正在使用？</h3>
        <p>
          確認客戶、供應商與驗證狀態。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="map-card">
        <div class="number">03</div>
        <h3>證據到哪裡？</h3>
        <p>
          區分開發、驗證、導入與量產。
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <article class="research-card">

    <span class="tag">FACTS FIRST</span>

    <h2>投資研究的起點，是技術證據。</h2>

    <p>
      本網站不以單一市場題材作為研究結論，
      而是將技術路徑與公開資訊放在第一順位。
    </p>

  </article>

</section>

<nav class="research-nav">
  <a href="/research/vol01/p5">← P5 · Glass Core</a>
  <a href="../">Vol.01 目錄</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01/p7">P7 · Future Watch →</a>
</nav>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.research-card{border:1px solid #344457;background:rgba(18,27,38,.82);border-radius:18px;padding:34px}
.research-card h2{font-size:31px;margin:12px 0 20px}
.research-card p{color:#aeb9c6;max-width:850px}
.research-nav{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px 70px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.research-nav a{color:#b8c8d9;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:800px){.research-card{padding:25px}.research-nav{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
